# Rules Phân tích (Requirement Studio Knowledge)

> Pointer-only (Phase 4): không copy full rule text ở `.mdc`.
>
> Runtime SoT:
> - [`api/app/llm/analysis_rules.py`](api/app/llm/analysis_rules.py)
> - [`api/app/features/requirement_studio/knowledge_builder.py`](api/app/features/requirement_studio/knowledge_builder.py)
> - Registry: [`api/app/rules/rule_registry.yaml`](api/app/rules/rule_registry.yaml)
>
> Selective profiles:
> - `PROFILE-ANALYSIS-ENRICH`
> - `PROFILE-ANALYSIS-CHAT`
>
> Observability:
> - Log format: `RuleProfile apply profile=<...> mode=<...> ids=<rule_ids> chars=<n>`

Khi sửa rule phân tích, chỉ cập nhật runtime SoT + registry, giữ file này làm chỉ mục/pointer.
